# Agents index

After creating, renaming, or deleting a nested `AGENTS.md`, `SKILL.md`, or `/opsx-*` command, run `npm run agents:check`.

If it fails, fix the root `AGENTS.md` index (add the new path or drop the stale one) and run the check again. Do not finish while it is red.
